# Pairs with HandOffBound. Moved from the design's
# ReadPositionHonestStampAtAppend. The append is stamped with the initiator's
# generation when it is sent, not when the write was admitted, so a write admitted
# before the close carries the re-claimed generation and is accepted above the
# recorded head.
MODULE: HandOffBoundStampAtAppend
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreign append carries the initiator's current generation instead of the one it was admitted under
PERTURBS: ForeignAlloc, ForeignReject

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp >= fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
\* MUTATION: stamped at append time.
    /\ fEpoch >= fFence
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ fpend
    /\ fstamp < fFence
--- REPLACE
    /\ fpend
    /\ fEpoch < fFence
--- END
